From: coenttb <coen@coenttb.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:43:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 ...wift => __Array where S is Store.`Protocol` & ~Copyable.swift} | 0
 ...is ~Copyable, S is Store.`Protocol` & Buffer.`Protocol`.swift} | 0
 ...wift => __Array where S is ~Copyable, S is Store.Direct.swift} | 0
 Sources/Array/{Array+Columns.swift => __Array.swift}              | 0
 4 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Array Primitive/{Array.Index.swift => __Array where S is Store.`Protocol` & ~Copyable.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Array Primitive/{Array.Shared.swift => __Array where S is ~Copyable, S is Store.`Protocol` & Buffer.`Protocol`.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Array Small Primitive/{Array.Small.swift => __Array where S is ~Copyable, S is Store.Direct.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Array/{Array+Columns.swift => __Array.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Array Primitive/Array.Index.swift b/Sources/Array Primitive/__Array where S is Store.`Protocol` & ~Copyable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Array Primitive/Array.Index.swift
rename to Sources/Array Primitive/__Array where S is Store.`Protocol` & ~Copyable.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Array Primitive/Array.Shared.swift b/Sources/Array Primitive/__Array where S is ~Copyable, S is Store.`Protocol` & Buffer.`Protocol`.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Array Primitive/Array.Shared.swift
rename to Sources/Array Primitive/__Array where S is ~Copyable, S is Store.`Protocol` & Buffer.`Protocol`.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Array Small Primitive/Array.Small.swift b/Sources/Array Small Primitive/__Array where S is ~Copyable, S is Store.Direct.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Array Small Primitive/Array.Small.swift
rename to Sources/Array Small Primitive/__Array where S is ~Copyable, S is Store.Direct.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Array/Array+Columns.swift b/Sources/Array/__Array.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Array/Array+Columns.swift
rename to Sources/Array/__Array.swift
